    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-intl.locale.prototype.getWeekInfo\ndescription: >\n  When the locale has no region but has a subdivision (\"sd\") keyword, the\n  subdivision's region is used to derive the week info.\ninfo: |\n  RegionPreference ( locale )\n  1. Let _region_ be GetLocaleRegion(_locale_).\n  2. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n    a. Set _region_ to CanonicalUnicodeSubdivision(_locale_, *\"sd\"*).\n    b. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n      i. Let _maximal_ be the result of the Add Likely Subtags algorithm applied\n         to _locale_. If an error is signaled, set _maximal_ to _locale_.\n      ...\n  ...\nfeatures: [Intl.Locale, Intl.Locale-info]\n---",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 771
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " In order not to rely on a particular implementation's locale data, this test",
      "start": 773,
      "end": 852
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " searches for a suitable locale without a region subtag, but with a",
      "start": 853,
      "end": 922
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " subdivision (\"sd\" extension) whose region would influence the supported week",
      "start": 923,
      "end": 1002
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " info.",
      "start": 1003,
      "end": 1011
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "",
      "start": 1012,
      "end": 1014
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Each candidate below is a locale with a subdivision extension but no region",
      "start": 1015,
      "end": 1093
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " subtag, together with a locale that names that subdivision's region",
      "start": 1094,
      "end": 1164
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " explicitly (e.g. \"en-u-sd-inka\" has subdivision \"inka\", whose region is \"IN\",",
      "start": 1165,
      "end": 1245
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " so \"en-IN\"). Because such a locale has no region subtag, RegionPreference",
      "start": 1246,
      "end": 1322
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " must derive its region from the subdivision. Its week info must therefore be",
      "start": 1323,
      "end": 1402
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " identical to those of the paired region locale. An incorrect implementation",
      "start": 1403,
      "end": 1481
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " might instead ignore the \"sd\" extension and apply Add Likely Subtags to the",
      "start": 1482,
      "end": 1560
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " bare language, giving \"en-Latn-US\".",
      "start": 1561,
      "end": 1599
    }
  ],
